<title>USA: XTRA Corp elects eighth member to board.</title>
<headline>XTRA Corp elects eighth member to board.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Mass. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>XTRA Corp on Tuesday said its directors had raised the number of board members to eight from seven, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The board said it had elected Michael Bills, senior managing director of Tiger Managment Llc, as its eighth member.</p>
